Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon 是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon, she's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被Lucifer亲手挑选出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell are handpicked by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是你的王 - 说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm your king - About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要讨论一下更朝换代问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are goona talk about reign change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过后会想出办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam受伤了 伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.He's hurt real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条祈祷面向所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to any angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长耳朵的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 别急啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想帮忙吗 先说你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna help?Start with a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:00:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你救Sam - 还有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You save - There's a chance I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你弟弟 从他体内救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix your brother, from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何救\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我养伤的同时 也在帮Sam恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam while I'm healing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他康复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he's healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会醒过来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna wake up, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来以后呢 他会不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what he does, what, is he gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到你的存在 还是默默数伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel you inside?Triaging his spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会感觉到我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not feel me, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没理由让他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason for him to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他体内 如果Sam不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here at all.Without his acceptance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以在任何时候排斥我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can eject me, at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦Sam排斥我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Sam does eject me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在就守住这个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we keep it a secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 Cass变成人类了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, Cass is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了荣光 没了翅膀 没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No grace, no wings, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 什么天使技能都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harp, whatever the hell else he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he crash land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从公用电话上给我打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called me from a payphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时在科罗拉多的朗蒙特市 我让他\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Longmont, Colorado.I told him just to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去基地 - 你觉得他能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make for the bunker - You think he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大老远的跑去基地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle a road trip like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass也不小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是出了什么事 他知道我们的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things go breaking bad, he knows our number.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我在担心别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I got bigger worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠落的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fallen angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了Metatron 现在有好几千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean thanks to Metatron, we now have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,既困惑 又不稳定的核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of thousands confused loose nukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking around down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think they're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no damn clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley呢 你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Crowley?You.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love nothing better than.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉那个老混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ice that limey bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我又想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I thought to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Winchester会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Sam Winchester do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,会一刀插他脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stab him in the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.73,0:03:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我想到 地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I figured the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能知道不少的事 所以为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might know a few things, so why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他说出所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero Dark Thirty his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Crowley is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是我后备箱里的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'a a junk in my trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Dean吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活着回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 因为你瞄得太准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.'Cause you are a crappy shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟 饥饿游戏 女主一样准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近几天真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a bad couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着 吃不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't slept.I haven't eaten, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上厕所都很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've pretty backed-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you overshare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次跟你打过电话以后 这地方就完全失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we talked, this place went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种警报全在响\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there're some alarm on and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有机械设备都疯了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines are freaking out and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间房子又自己锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bunker just locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还打不开门 我的手机又不能用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't open the door myself.My cellphone stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为世界末日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the world's ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使都坠落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels' fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 下次再有世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, next time the world's ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好拿上枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机有信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是你从外面开门的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when you open the door from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统重启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The outside door reset the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这样最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.Let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候好过 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it ever.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都不会烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never get tired doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有家的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从哪儿找到这么漂亮的地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this fantasitic little tree house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.Here's how this gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我们地球上每一个恶魔的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give us the name of demon on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有被附身者的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the people they're possessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像我会干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你崩溃后的样子 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you break down, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我想治愈你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was trying to cure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你心里某处又回归了人性 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a part of you was human again, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在还在 我还知道 - 他她它 说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still lives.I also know - Bla bla boo.Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.Cause this is what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会告诉你们任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又没有谈条件的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no leverage, darlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一不会关了地狱的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna close the gate of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们之前有过机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,二不会杀了我 因为我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna kill me because you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问还有什么可谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒是有些想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a few ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷刑吗 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture.Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真等不及看Sam穿上高跟鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait to see Sam in stilettos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和女士紧身衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a lether bustier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正和Sam来场性虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really putting the S-A-M into S and M.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:06:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还能拿我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来就什么都试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I don't do to myself just for kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周五晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Crowley doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么还没死 你为什么还没一刀捅死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he dead.Why haven't you stabbed him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定 Kevin 我们需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill out, Kevin, okay, we need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能让Crowley直接告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get Crowley to give us the.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要恶魔的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name of demon he's got topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hunt them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会开口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他告诉我们全部之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?When he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓着他 你来动手杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hold him down while you knife him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就能吃着冰淇淋看脱衣舞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll all go up for ice-cream and strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他远点儿好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay away from him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去打几个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gonna make some phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续看天使预言板\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to hit the Angel Tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you could find anything on the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来清扫天堂的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Metatron used to empty out Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定咱们能在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe we could reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们惹大麻烦之前扭转局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the God's squad does too much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是我们有够幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 开始留心任何跟天使有关的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, checking out anything for angely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or demony.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者妖魔鬼怪的 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or monstery or ghosty or.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年可真有够忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a busy year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不多介绍了 咱们来聊聊你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But enough about me.Let's talk you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason告诉我 你们是一群暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason tells me that you're all violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯利是图的投机主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power-hungry opportunist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在谁来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱到底他妈的发什么了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有恶魔 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And demons, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就管这个破玩意儿叫肉身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that a meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年我接手了72宗交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I closed 72 deals last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩儿都喜欢老奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids love grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们居然在交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是掠夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what we should be taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁让Crowley当老大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put Crowley in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,舌头都被地狱恶犬吃了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhound got your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们居然听取他的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took orders from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的王应该征战\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该降伏四方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king conquers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是傻兮兮的坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king does more than sit around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,读什么交易契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 王死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the King's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以训练你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can train you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们新的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you new bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一起进军地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll march into Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被拥戴为解放地狱的革命者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we'll be greeted as liberators.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔就此崛起 扫荡全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And demonskind will rise up and sweep over the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人类 和坠落的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the humans and all the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their clipped wings will bow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然 就要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they'll burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那Crowley怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no offense, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们都以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we all thought you were dead until like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也一周前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Crowley回来了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if Crowley does come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, a lot of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前惧怕他 现在也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were scared of him, a lot of us still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明Crowley再也不会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove that Crowley's really gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的小计划就能奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then maybe the scheme of yours will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得你们几个骑士都被评价过高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought you Knights were overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 掉进人间的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Irv.fallen angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是一群衣冠禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just monsters With good PR.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你撞上了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you run into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔进圣油里炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torch his ass with the holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了 如果他掉了把 银质的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and if they drop a, like a silver sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万抢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西很好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those pig stickers come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, criminy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来挺奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look I know this is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪什么 我们每天都跟奇怪打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, Deano, weird is what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得那个在萨斯卡通市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this case me and Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Bobby一起遇到的那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked in Saskatoon and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人连体双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolf siamese twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次他喝高了都会讲一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time he drunk Labatt's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果碰上任何麻烦 打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you run into any troubles, give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 散播这个消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and…spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,越多猎人知道越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more hunters know the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Roger Dodger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一次去市里过周末对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's your first weekend to pass into town right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都安排好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I set it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim会在酒吧等着 他喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim's waiting at the bar and has a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着制服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For man in uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不停买酒就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you just start buying shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到早上再谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can thank me in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么部件坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the thingy broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以载你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give you a lift into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿就像被硫磺腌过一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place reeks of sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭气熏天 还有不正常的雷暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stink, the freak thunder storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,三公里之内的牛都死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cow dead within three miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌1000美元 绝对是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take demons for 1000, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stark特工 和Banner特工 FBI\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Agent Stark and Banner.FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要调查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need to have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是军事案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a military case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关政府的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a federal one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的顶头上司可不是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not what our supervisor said.
