Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的电脑都连的是一个网\N{\fnArial\fs30}All military computers are linked to the same network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
