Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人胸口有个弹孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this guys was shot in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,15 20年之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been 15, 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的每个人身上都有一处致命伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone on this bodies has a fatal wound.
