Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是时间都很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're all old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们看到的只是肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking at meatsuits.
