Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的恶魔还是活蹦乱跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons inside kept'em ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they were possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在那些士兵也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now those soldiers are.
