Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了一台监控摄像机的录影带\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pulled this off a security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要看一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你烧掉那具肉身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you Kentucky fried that meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我烧了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她是怎么回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how did she get it back.
