Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你Winchester兄弟俩在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said where the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你去死吧 小平头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said bite me, crew cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你们该怎么做吧 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you how it's done, boys.
