Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们来聊聊Sam和Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's talk Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Dean的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean's number.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是他 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are not a Winchester, who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你给那俩兄弟带个话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to give those boys a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手上有他们可能想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something they might want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin 等等 慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, wait, wait, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了我一个坐标 44 053051 123 12786028\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave me this coordinate, 44.053051by - 123.12786088.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两个名字 Irv Franklin和Tracy Bell\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two names, Irv Franklin and Tracy Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Irv是我们的朋友 不知道Tracy是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irv is a friend, don't know Tracy.
