Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, who was she.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 新任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去翻看学者们所有关于地狱骑士的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig up everything men of letters have on Knights of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一个能杀掉他们的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find a way to kill one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是 永远死去的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个坐标指向俄勒冈州的尤金市\N{\fnArial\fs30}That numbers point to a spot on the outskirts of Eugene, Oregon.
