Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还这样自己掉进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we just gonna walk right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns blazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会和我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是第三项试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the third trial, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被我们困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能被原谅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To even looking for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个恶魔马上就要变成凡人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your demon ass is going to be a mortal ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些对你来说都毫无意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this means anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她值得被爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我值得被爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想要被爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I know it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里都能分辨出你小脚丫的脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognize the pitter-patter of your little feet anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 逃避 你只会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, run, that's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是 那个词怎么说 软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, what's the word?Weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 Kev\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi ya, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前这里的化工厂发生了泄漏事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local chemical plant sprung a leak years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们疏散了方圆几公里内的街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have evacuated three squares of blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜污染应该还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's still contaminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地方都被污染了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole place is poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点防护措施没坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Irv\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irv.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon一直在折磨猎人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon' s been torturing hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在打听你们的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to get an intel on you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 她不是想给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I serious doubt, she wants to add you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄圣诞贺卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}To her Christmas card list.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底要不要救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you want to make with the rescue or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们用圣水试一下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after you take a shot of holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会想看到我们变成黑眼恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing you need is us popping black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tracy 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Sam Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是新人 我们在萨克拉门多一起工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's new, We did shifter job in Sacramento together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很聪明 但是有点多话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart, but got a mouth on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来我的闺房了 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what brings you to my boudoir, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我怎么杀掉地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to tell me how to kill a Knight of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon给你们添麻烦了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon giveing you trouble, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 你放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, you let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲手帮你收拾那个小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll spit roast the little whore for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.11,0:21:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.55,0:21:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 我知道她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, I know she'd love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,又瘦弱又听话 正合她的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinny, submissive.You're just here type.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.43,0:22:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你来找我的真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what you came for anyway, no really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on you mind, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我 我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell me, we are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你折磨过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我折磨我的所有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tortured all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我展现爱意的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I show love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个不正常的家庭环境中长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised in a dysfunctional home environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.23,0:22:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你能肯定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean are you sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过她的尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever see a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么确信她就死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean how could you be sure she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.23,0:22:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力不止这样 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do better than that, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.65,0:22:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.65,0:22:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,发泄出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们有圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right we got Jesus juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪 填满刻着恶魔陷阱的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun loaded with devil's trap bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给恶魔一枪 就能困住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot a demon, put them on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使之刃很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angle blade works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.83,0:23:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带了来福枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got assault rifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.55,0:23:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the play.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.22,0:23:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抓我们啊 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, you dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.33,0:23:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抓我们啊 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, you dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抓我们啊 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, you dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们现在要拿出海豹突击队的阵势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, We got to flank SEAL team douche in there, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Irv 你和我从左边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lrv, you and me go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam和Tracy从右边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Tracy go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.25,0:23:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.51,0:23:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人都是因为他死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family's dead because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.19,0:23:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:23:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.87,0:24:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀我的父母 与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaughter my parents, and the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它谈论着它要如何庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It talked about how it was celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个蠢货把Lucifer放出了牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}How some dumb kid let Lucifer out of his cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们得行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, alright, we got to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.39,0:24:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Irv\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irv.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.02,0:24:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你感觉到你的感受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you've felt your feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.13,0:24:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我简单点说 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make this simple, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.17,0:24:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.41,0:24:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你妈妈还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll give you back your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.10,0:24:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 她想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she wishes she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在经历过这么多苦痛之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I had my heavies do to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.60,0:24:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她求着我让她去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's begging for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你知道 我是不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when have you ever known me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让任何人轻易逃脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To let anyone off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为Sam和Dean在乎她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Sam and Dean care about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.29,0:25:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他们在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在这满足他们的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just here to serve their needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.65,0:25:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.51,0:25:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总有一天会失去一切 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lose, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.53,0:25:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.22,0:25:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当Winchester们利用完你之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Winchesters are done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.61,0:25:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会毫不犹豫的把你扔到一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll toss you aside without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.33,0:25:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们认为自己是特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they think they are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有下一个先知可以任他们使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always another prophet waiting in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我才是身披镣铐的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这儿 你我都是囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are both prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我走 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.47,0:25:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起走出这些门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walk out those doors together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起赢 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say we both win.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我想他们还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay I think they are still inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着他们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait till they come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个一个打到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we pick them off one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.83,0:26:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 为保准起见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam不是唯一一个认为自己做了正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not the only guy who thought he is doing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却眼睁睁看着灾难来临的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And watched it all go to crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.85,0:26:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 这只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's just part of being.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为猎人的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.98,0:26:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是作为人的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.59,0:26:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想对Sam生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you want to be pissed off at Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.88,0:26:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你想向谁寻仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to go after somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.27,0:26:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得确保那是个黑眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make sure they got black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道什么才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to know what the real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的邪恶 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are in this world, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.05,0:26:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you copacetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.23,0:26:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.19,0:26:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.73,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的家伙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hand me that toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.85,0:26:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 Dean和Tracy赶紧离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and Dean and Tracy beat feet out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.22,0:26:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.01,0:26:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们争取尽可能多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And buy you as long time as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.44,0:26:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Irv 这等同于自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irv, that's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.17,0:26:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.22,0:26:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I got coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.53,0:26:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的错 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正泡在酒馆里 有了个艳遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some dive, sloppy, and I met some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.16,0:27:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我再次清醒过来 我就被困在了一张床里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing you know.I'm trapped to some bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.76,0:27:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用尽方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's twisting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't supposed to be twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She who.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.68,0:27:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.92,0:27:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我交出了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pete Tracy 我交出了他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, Tracy, I gave them all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你给我那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you hand me that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.77,0:27:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我做我必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you let me do what I got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.00,0:27:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.16,0:27:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩合作还挺愉快的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice grouping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.22,0:27:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevlar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.62,0:27:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比附魔子弹强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat magic bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱高科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.10,0:28:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我的车在三个街区之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my car is three blocks over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.42,0:28:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿些子弹 拿些圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get more bullets, more holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拿什么拿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.86,0:28:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.87,0:28:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go, go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.34,0:28:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于就剩我们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.88,0:28:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.69,0:28:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我没错过最精彩的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, I didn't miss the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你们在我打完电话之后就赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So appreciate you boys coming when I call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我这么喜欢你们Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's what I like most about you Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.35,0:29:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是那么听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.19,0:29:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着自我毁灭式的愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suicidally stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.76,0:29:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想跟我打一架还是滚床单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna fight or make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.91,0:29:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我真的有点儿搞不清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I'm getting some real mixed signals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what's left of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.35,0:29:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那对我有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.What's in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.42,0:29:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我Crowley的首级\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me Crowley's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.80,0:29:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就又快又干脆地扭断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will snip your neck quick and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不会感觉到什么 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't feel a thing, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.77,0:29:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我告诉你一边去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I tell you to get bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.89,0:29:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.31,0:29:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我第一眼见到 我就一直很爱你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've loved this body since the moment I first saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.33,0:29:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个完美的皮囊 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the perfect vessel, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.46,0:29:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,集女孩子所有肮脏的小想法于一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give a girl all sorts of nasty ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.26,0:29:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以随便你怎么装作很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead and play hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弄下这个防恶魔纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll peel off this No-demon-allowed tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后化成黑烟钻进你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And blow smoke up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.85,0:29:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.37,0:29:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.54,0:29:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能是个恐怖片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a horror show out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比恐怖片更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.25,0:29:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.23,0:29:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我进入你的身体 我会让你看着全过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause once I'm on top, I'll make you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.23,0:29:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我会用你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll use your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.33,0:30:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道婴儿的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever felt an infant's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.39,0:30:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,流过下巴时的感受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drip down your chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.26,0:30:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者在你撕碎一个女孩的肠子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or listen to a girl scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着她尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you rip her guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.74,0:30:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会亲自体验到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.49,0:30:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.82,0:30:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a grand old time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.44,0:30:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们Winchester都很厉害呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you Winchesters are supposed to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.46,0:30:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你以为我们会没带帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think we'd roll up to this mouse trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.06,0:30:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就闯进这个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without some backups.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.36,0:31:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们差点儿就杀了他 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were going to kill him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.12,0:31:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.05,0:31:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在保护你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was protecting your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.67,0:31:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that's what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.10,0:31:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是的 是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.69,0:31:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 抱歉我还在适应这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…Sorry I'm still getting used to this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.33,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.43,0:31:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Sam没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.29,0:31:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被打昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's knocked unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.14,0:31:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某种程度上 他还没清醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a way, he still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam一点也不会记得这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam will not remember any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.67,0:31:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒过来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the hell am I supposed to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.74,0:31:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么跟他解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he comes to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.18,0:31:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我刚才用了匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's why I used the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.06,0:31:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.30,0:32:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.93,0:32:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你还是很不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are troubled still.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.03,0:32:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.42,0:32:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我跟Sam说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who talked to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.69,0:32:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃关上地狱之门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of boarding up hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.44,0:32:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以恶魔的每个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Kay?So, every demon deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.70,0:32:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every kill that they make.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.84,0:32:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你面前就站的是罪魁祸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at the person who let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.13,0:32:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在保护你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're protecting your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.16,0:32:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能进入Sam的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in Sam's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.01,0:32:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道的每件事 我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he knows, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你所作的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.58,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是出于兄弟情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did out of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.86,0:32:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 听着 Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, look, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.36,0:32:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就叫你Zeke了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call you Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那种会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really with the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.11,0:32:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love and.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.67,0:32:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情啊之类的 - 这就是我答应的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Love - But it is the why I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 如果连这都出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and if that goes sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.03,0:32:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.89,0:32:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.69,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你是Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you're Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你又不是Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,平时都是我跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And normally he's the one I'm taking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.57,0:33:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你 Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trusting you, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to hope that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.42,0:33:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one of those good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.96,0:33:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.93,0:33:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是估计坏人也会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I suppose that is what a bad guy would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.39,0:33:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean Winchester 你所作的事是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester, you are doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.11,0:33:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what the hell happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被人打昏倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a shot to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来救了你 跟平时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I came in and saved your ass, like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.79,0:34:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你单挑了三个恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed three demons alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是出其不备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took them by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.70,0:34:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点混乱 但是运气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a little messy, I get a little lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.95,0:34:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.92,0:34:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awesome, so there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.40,0:34:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Geez - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.55,0:34:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害已经不能形容你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty damn awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.22,0:34:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.22,0:34:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.77,0:34:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一般一般 - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More or less, yeah - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都搞定了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got everything but.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.95,0:34:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm late to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.54,0:34:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.10,0:34:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧离开这个破地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's blow this toxic waste dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.39,0:34:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去吃顿好饭 洗个舒服澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burges and silkwood showers on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.17,0:35:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.23,0:35:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.51,0:35:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who worked you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Martin Hayward\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin Hayward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.98,0:35:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Brandon Favors\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Brandon Favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.16,0:35:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你弄成这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.55,0:35:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是附他们身的恶魔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.62,0:35:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们问我名字 我就告诉你名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask for names and I'm giving you names.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.35,0:35:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最近很得宠\N{\fnArial\fs30}They under underperformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.40,0:35:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们干掉 就算是帮我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spike them you're doing me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.29,0:35:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 让你开口还真是容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you break easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.97,0:35:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.37,0:35:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说是你那倒霉计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little plan to have me stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.03,0:35:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我一个人扔下什么的起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my own delicious juicies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.88,0:35:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就真是可笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.44,0:35:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want things do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.73,0:36:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以某些程度上达成一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can come to some kind of arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.45,0:36:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼尚往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quid pro quo, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.76,0:36:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这又算什么 赠品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these are what then.Freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.11,0:36:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.21,0:36:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can consider them fair trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.04,0:36:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,娱乐我的回报吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the enjoyment that Kevin gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.34,0:36:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that suppose to mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.91,0:36:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的新宠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my new favourite toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩儿过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.14,0:36:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看着他离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去查那两个恶魔 我来找Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check the names.I'll find the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.31,0:36:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.29,0:36:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我关在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't keep me locked in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.70,0:36:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.53,0:37:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.79,0:37:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们告诉过你不要和Crowley讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man we told you not to talk to Crowley, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.01,0:37:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会搅乱你的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}He messes with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.03,0:37:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 我妈妈还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says my mom's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.84,0:37:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley说如果我放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley said if I let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.66,0:37:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈就能回到我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd give her back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就相信他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.22,0:37:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还被关在那儿 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in there, isn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.24,0:37:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.67,0:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.97,0:37:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if she is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.01,0:37:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 她已经死了 Kevin 节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every way that matters.She's dead, Kevin.I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想出去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're dying to bolt, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.71,0:37:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.51,0:37:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 门外 是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But out that door.It's demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.62,0:37:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,和天使 他们都非常想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And angels.And they would all love.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.85,0:37:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get their hands on a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.67,0:37:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以即使Crowley在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So even with Crowley's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.48,0:37:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿仍然是最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still the safest place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.45,0:37:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,最安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.42,0:37:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.00,0:37:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I'm useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.63,0:37:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.50,0:38:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在经历了这样那样的挫折之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all the crap we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.88,0:38:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你为我们付出如此多之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all the good you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.95,0:38:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不相信我们会为你去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man if you don't think we'll die for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.73,0:38:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道该怎么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.21,0:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我 Sam和Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you, me, Sam and Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.20,0:38:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果 你觉得这一切都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey, if none of that matters to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.28,0:38:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会阻拦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.59,0:38:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin在某个空房间里睡死过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's passed in one of the back rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子挺坚强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a tough kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.53,0:38:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会挺过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll bounce back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.34,0:38:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.95,0:38:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.54,0:38:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.25,0:38:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tracy说我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Tracy said about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.70,0:38:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.09,0:39:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.14,0:39:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拯救的人远多于\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've helped a hell lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.88,0:39:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤害的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than you've hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.95,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.65,0:39:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was then, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.38,0:39:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬现在的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.90,0:39:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.76,0:39:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠落的天使 Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fallen angels, Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.61,0:39:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去荣光的Cass 地下室里的Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass losing his halo, Crowley in our basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.76,0:39:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像生活在情景喜剧里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap, we're living in a freakin' sitcom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?How is the.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.12,0:39:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The engine running.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.57,0:39:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实在的 我现在感觉比以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I feel better than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.03,0:39:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.02,0:39:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道外面现在很乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I realize it's crazy out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.05,0:39:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有数不尽的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have trouble coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.71,0:39:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我看到身边都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I look around I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.06,0:39:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.67,0:39:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很享受现在的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.11,0:39:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久以来的第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.96,0:40:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.30,0:40:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.69,0:40:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也没有比这更好的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never better.
